Discord](https://www.spigotmc.org/link-forums/discord.95/)\n  * [Hub](https://www.spigotmc.org/link-forums/hub.75/)\n  * [Issues](https://www.spigotmc.org/link-forums/issues.14/)\n  * [Members](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/) [](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/)\n    * [Notable Members](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/)\n    * [Current Visitors](https://www.spigotmc.org/online/)\n    * [Recent Activity](https://www.spigotmc.org/recent-activity/)\n    * [New Profile Posts](https://www.spigotmc.org/find-new/profile-posts)\n  * [Donate](https://www.spigotmc.org/pages/donate/)\n\n\n[](https://www.spigotmc.org/) \n\nYour username or email address:\n     \n\nPassword:\n    \n[Forgot your password?](https://www.spigotmc.org/lost-password/)      Stay logged in\n[](https://www.spigotmc.org/)\n  * [ Menu ](https://www.spigotmc.org/)\n  * [Wiki](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/) [](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/)\n  * [Members](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/) [](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/)\n\n\n**SpigotMC - High Performance Minecraft Software**\n[Home](https://www.spigotmc.org/) [Wiki](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/)\n# Forums\n[](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/) Dec 13, 2016\n  * [Page](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/forums/#wikiContent)\n  * [History](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/forums/#history)\n  * [Editors](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/forums/#editors)\n\n\n  * **\nThis page is currently incomplete. Please help add to it by recommending and/or adding additional pages!\n**  \n![\\[​IMG\\]](https://proxy.spigotmc.org/6e9c49ba71a5e397bf0f4d8d0165bdc34d86e8f5/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f507671547956552e706e67)​\n**About Spigot**  \n\n    * [Spigot Forum Rules](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-rules/)\n    * [Forums Ranks](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/ranks/)\n    * [History of Spigot](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/history-of-spigot/)\n    * [Donations](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/donations/)\n**IRC**  \n\n    * [Spigot IRC Rules](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-irc-rules/)\n    * [IRC Guide](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/irc-guide/)\n  \n**Resources**  \n\n    * [About Resources](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/resources/)\n  \n**Services & Recruitment**  \n\n    * [Hiring and Offering FAQ](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/services-recruitment/)\n    * [Server Administration](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/server-management-administration/)\n  * Loading...\n  * Loading...\n\n\n(42053 Views) \nLast Modified: Dec 13, 2016 at 4:22 AM \n[XenCarta PRO](http://xenforo.com/community/resources/1690/) © Jason Axelrod from [8WAYRUN.COM](http://8wayrun.com/)\n### Sponsors\n[ ![Minecraft Server List](https://static.spigotmc.org/img/minecraft-server-list.png) ](https://minecraft-server-list.com/ \"Looking for a server to play Minecraft on or to extend your servers playerbase? Minecraft Server List is an extensive list of Minecraft servers from around the world. Submit your server, let your players vote for it and gain even more players forward.\") [ ![Aternos](https://static.spigotmc.org/img/aternos.png) ](https://www.spigotmc.org/go/aternos \"Minecraft servers. Free. Forever.\") [ ![Tebex Donation Plugin & Webstore](https://static.spigotmc.org/img/tebex.png) ](https://www.spigotmc.org/go/tebex \"Struggling to cover the costs of your Minecraft Server? Setup your\nown webstore with Tebex in under 30 seconds.\")\n[Sign up now!](https://www.spigotmc.org/register/)\n### Wiki Navigation\n  * **Forums**\n  * [Adding Plugins](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/adding-plugins/)\n  * [Donations](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/donations/)\n  * [History of Spigot](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/history-of-spigot/)\n  * [Hosting Or Contabo VPS?](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/hosting-or-contabo-vps/)\n  * [IRC Guide](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/irc-guide/)\n  * [Ranks](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/ranks/)\n  * [Services & Recruitment](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/services-recruitment/)\n  * [Spigot Forum Rules](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-rules/)\n  * [Spigot IRC Rules](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-irc-rules/)\n  * [SpigotMC Privacy Policy](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-privacy/)\n  * [SpigotMC Terms of Use](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-terms/)\n\n\n### [Wiki Index](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/)\n  * [BungeeCord](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord/)\n  * **Forums**\n  * [Spigot](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot/)\n\n\n### Top Editors \n\n[Mineplugins](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/mineplugins.173014/)\n    386 \n\n[smmmadden](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/smmmadden.104514/)\n    375 \n\n[Jeppa](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/jeppa.50435/)\n    373 \n\n[RockinChaos](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/rockinchaos.3051/)\n    343 \n\n[Maximvdw](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/maximvdw.6687/)\n    325 \n\n[Blackixx](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/blackixx.649/)\n    235 \n\n[Indyuce](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/indyuce.253965/)\n    230 \n\n[BrettPlays](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/brettplays.80037/)\n    205 \n\n[Phoenix616](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/phoenix616.3651/)\n    191 \n\n[Zrips](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/zrips.24572/)\n    179\n### Wiki Statistics \n\nPages:\n    1,407 \n\nEdits:\n    13,453 \n\nLikes:\n    0 \n\nViews:\n    39,877,202 \n\nAttached Files:\n    13 (318.6 KB)\n**SpigotMC - High Performance Minecraft Software**\n[Home](https://www.spigotmc.org/) [Wiki](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/) \n\nStyle\n\n  * [FAQ](https://www.spigotmc.org/threads/311785/)\n  * [Contact Us](https://www.spigotmc.org/threads/contact-us.321793/)\n  * [Terms](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-terms/)\n  * [Rules](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-rules/)\n  * [Privacy Policy](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-privacy/)\n\n\n  * [](https://www.spigotmc.org/threads/contact-us.321793/)\n  * [](https://www.spigotmc.org/forums/-/index.rss)\n\n\n© 2012-2026 SpigotMC Pty. Ltd.   \nNot an official Minecraft product or service. Not approved by Mojang or Microsoft. \nTheme designed by [ThemeHouse](https://www.themehouse.com/xenforo/themes \"Premium XenForo Themes\").\n**SpigotMC - High Performance Minecraft Software**\n[Home](https://www.spigotmc.org/) [Wiki](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/)\n←→\nSunMonTueWedThuFriSat\n### Home\nQuick Links\n  * [Recent Posts](https://www.spigotmc.org/find-new/posts)\n  * [Recent Activity](https://www.spigotmc.org/recent-activity/)\n\n\n### Forums\nQuick Links\n  * [Search Forums](https://www.spigotmc.org/search/?type=post)\n  * [Recent Posts](https://www.spigotmc.org/find-new/posts)\n\n\n### Resources\nQuick Links\n  * [Search Resources](https://www.spigotmc.org/search/?type=resource_update)\n  * [Most Resources](https://www.spigotmc.org/resources/authors)\n  * [Latest Reviews](https://www.spigotmc.org/resources/reviews)\n\n\n### Useful Searches\n  * [Recent Posts](https://www.spigotmc.org/find-new/posts?recent=1)\n\n\n### Team\nQuick Links\n  * [Administrator](https://www.spigotmc.org/XenStaff/#Administrator)\n  * [Moderator](https://www.spigotmc.org/XenStaff/#Moderator)\n  * [Sponsor](https://www.spigotmc.org/XenStaff/#Sponsor)\n  * [Developer](https://www.spigotmc.org/XenStaff/#Developer)\n  * [Wiki Team](https://www.spigotmc.org/XenStaff/#Wiki%20Team)\n  * [Services Moderator](https://www.spigotmc.org/XenStaff/#Services%20Moderator)\n  * [Junior Moderator](https://www.spigotmc.org/XenStaff/#Junior%20Moderator)\n  * [Resources Moderator](https://www.spigotmc.org/XenStaff/#Resources%20Moderator)\n\n\n### Downloads\nQuick Links\n  * [Spigot / BuildTools](https://www.spigotmc.org/link-forums/spigot-buildtools.88/)\n  * [BungeeCord](https://www.spigotmc.org/link-forums/bungeecord.28/)\n\n\n### Members\nQuick Links\n  * [Notable Members](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/)\n  * [Current Visitors](https://www.spigotmc.org/online/)\n  * [Recent Activity](https://www.spigotmc.org/recent-activity/)\n  * [New Profile Posts](https://www.spigotmc.org/find-new/profile-posts)